<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!-- Sideload flavor additions. EMPTY on purpose since v0.48.0: this file used to carry
     REQUEST_INSTALL_PACKAGES and a FileProvider for the in-app self-updater, which is now off in
     every flavor (see ENABLE_UPDATER in app/build.gradle.kts). A permission whose feature is
     compiled out is a permission nobody can justify, so it is gone rather than dormant.

     The file itself stays so the flavor keeps a manifest to merge, and so restoring the updater
     is a revert of one commit rather than an archaeology exercise. -->
